From b6f3f0e092061df27096a4d729dd1d4bd765cc3c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Astra <astra@localhost>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 15:33:51 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Astra Launcher: branding, dark glass themes, Astra
 background, own service keys

- Rename to Astra Launcher (own data folder), new logo / icons / mac .icon
- AstraTheme: 7 dark glass variants (Amethyst default) with a shared rounded stylesheet
- Astra background art, shown by default
- Remove Prism's MSA client ID and CurseForge key (forks must use their own; CI reads repo secrets)
- Disable Prism updater and community links; CI artifact names
- ASTRA.md: how to build on GitHub Actions and register the Microsoft app
